---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout 
	title="diceforce IT | About Us | Enterprise AI & Cognitive Engineering" 
	description="Accelerating Enterprise Transformation Using Engineering Intelligence. Learn about our mission, principles, expertise, and leadership board at DiceForce IT."
	activePage="about"
>
	<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-col gap-20 md:gap-28 relative">
		
		<!-- SECTION 1: HERO / WELCOME -->
		<section class="space-y-8 animate-stagger-item relative z-10 pt-4 md:pt-8">
			<div class="space-y-6">
				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/20 backdrop-blur-md">
					<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-ping"></span>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 uppercase font-semibold">Welcome to DiceForce IT</span>
				</div>
				
				<h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.08] font-syne select-text max-w-5xl">
					Accelerating Enterprise Transformation Using <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-blue-400 to-indigo-400">Engineering Intelligence.</span>
				</h1>
				
				<p class="text-neutral-300 text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl max-w-4xl leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
					At DiceForce IT, we help COOs, CTOs, and CEOs to engineer, operationalize, and scale intelligent systems through AI/ML, Agentic AI, and enterprise software engineering to compete with real-world challenges.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- CTA Buttons -->
			<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-2">
				<a 
					href="#contact-form" 
					class="px-8 py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-500 text-black font-bold rounded-full hover:shadow-[0_0_35px_0_rgba(34,211,238,0.5)] hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wider uppercase inline-flex items-center gap-2"
				>
					<span>Talk to an AI Expert</span>
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
					</svg>
				</a>
				
				<a 
					href="#achieve" 
					class="px-8 py-4 border border-white/15 hover:border-cyan-400/40 text-white font-semibold rounded-full bg-white/[0.03] hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wider uppercase inline-flex items-center gap-2"
				>
					<span>Explore Our Services</span>
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
					</svg>
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- SECTION 2: PARTICLES TWO-COLUMN GRID (AI/ML & IT Staffing) - FULL WIDTH & TRANSPARENT -->
		<section class="relative w-screen left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 animate-stagger-item h-[85vh] min-h-[600px] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
			<!-- Canvas for Particles covering the entire section background -->
			<canvas id="about-particles-canvas" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0"></canvas>

			<div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-16">
				
				<!-- Left Column: AI & ML -->
				<div id="aiml-content-box" class="relative p-8 md:p-12 transition-all duration-500 group flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center min-h-[320px]">
					<div class="space-y-6 flex flex-col items-center">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/20">
							<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 uppercase">COGNITIVE PIPELINES</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-syne font-semibold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-cyan-100 to-cyan-300 tracking-tight leading-tight select-text group-hover:scale-102 transition-transform duration-500">
							AI & Machine Learning
						</h3>
					</div>
					
					<div class="pt-8">
						<a 
							href="/ai-ml" 
							class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-500 text-black font-semibold rounded-full hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_0_rgba(34,211,238,0.4)] hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 text-xs tracking-wider uppercase inline-block whitespace-nowrap"
						>
							Explore AI Solutions
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Right Column: IT Staffing -->
				<div id="staffing-content-box" class="relative p-8 md:p-12 transition-all duration-500 group flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center min-h-[320px]">
					<div class="space-y-6 flex flex-col items-center">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 border border-indigo-500/20 rounded-full bg-indigo-950/20">
							<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-indigo-400 uppercase">EMBEDDED ENGINEERS</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-syne font-semibold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-indigo-100 to-indigo-300 tracking-tight leading-tight select-text group-hover:scale-102 transition-transform duration-500">
							IT Staffing & Teams
						</h3>
					</div>
					
					<div class="pt-8">
						<a 
							href="/it-staffing" 
							class="px-8 py-3.5 border border-indigo-500/30 hover:border-indigo-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-indigo-950/20 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_0_rgba(99,102,241,0.3)] hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 text-xs tracking-wider uppercase inline-block whitespace-nowrap"
						>
							View Staffing Roster
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- SECTION 3: MISSION, VISION & EXPERTISE -->
		<section class="space-y-12 pt-16 relative z-10">
			<!-- Mission & Vision Cards -->
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
				<!-- Mission Card -->
				<div class="relative group p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-xl hover:border-cyan-500/30 hover:bg-cyan-500/[0.02] transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-400/10 border border-cyan-400/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
								<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold font-syne text-white tracking-tight">Our Mission</h2>
						<p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
							At DiceForce IT, we engineer the future of enterprise software. Our mission is to bridge the gap between today's complex technology demands in the market and the supply of skilled AI engineers who can use pro-code, low-code, and no-code tools effectively. By combining intelligent automation and deep engineering expertise, we help organizations automate DevOps and scale their productivity using AI systems with absolute confidence.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Vision Card -->
				<div class="relative group p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-xl hover:border-indigo-500/30 hover:bg-indigo-500/[0.02] transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-400/10 border border-indigo-400/20 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
								<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
								<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z" />
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold font-syne text-white tracking-tight">Our Vision</h2>
						<p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
							To reshape how the world’s enterprises build, launch, and run AI. We want to be the engineering partner you trust implicitly to guide your digital transformation and build technology that’s ready for whatever comes next.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Our Expertise Badges/Grid -->
			<div class="space-y-6 pt-6">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
					<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 uppercase">[ CORE CAPABILITIES ]</span>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold font-syne text-white">Our Expertise</h3>
				
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
					<div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-cyan-400/40 hover:bg-cyan-400/[0.04] transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-3 group">
						<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"></span>
						<span class="text-white font-space text-sm font-semibold">Enterprise AI</span>
					</div>
					<div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-blue-400/40 hover:bg-blue-400/[0.04] transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-3 group">
						<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-400 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"></span>
						<span class="text-white font-space text-sm font-semibold">Agentic AI</span>
					</div>
					<div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-indigo-400/40 hover:bg-indigo-400/[0.04] transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-3 group">
						<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"></span>
						<span class="text-white font-space text-sm font-semibold">Intelligent Enterprises</span>
					</div>
					<div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-purple-400/40 hover:bg-purple-400/[0.04] transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-3 group">
						<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-purple-400 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"></span>
						<span class="text-white font-space text-sm font-semibold">AI Engineering Excellence</span>
					</div>
					<div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] hover:border-teal-400/40 hover:bg-teal-400/[0.04] transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-3 group">
						<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"></span>
						<span class="text-white font-space text-sm font-semibold">Responsible AI</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- METRICS BAND 1 -->
		<section class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-6 py-6">
			<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] text-center space-y-1 hover:border-white/10 transition-colors">
				<div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold font-syne text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-400">98%+</div>
				<div class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-neutral-400 tracking-wider uppercase">Clients Served</div>
			</div>
			<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] text-center space-y-1 hover:border-white/10 transition-colors">
				<div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold font-syne text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-indigo-400">150+</div>
				<div class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-neutral-400 tracking-wider uppercase">Projects Done</div>
			</div>
			<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] text-center space-y-1 hover:border-white/10 transition-colors">
				<div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold font-syne text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 to-purple-400">4.9★</div>
				<div class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-neutral-400 tracking-wider uppercase">Google Rating</div>
			</div>
			<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] text-center space-y-1 hover:border-white/10 transition-colors">
				<div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold font-syne text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-300 to-teal-400">$50M+</div>
				<div class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-neutral-400 tracking-wider uppercase">Revenue Impact</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- SECTION 4: OUR PRINCIPLES -->
		<section class="space-y-12">
			<div class="space-y-4 max-w-3xl">
				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/20">
					<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 uppercase">OUR PRINCIPLES</span>
				</div>
				<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold font-syne text-white tracking-tight">
					The Principles That Power Every Solution
				</h2>
				<p class="text-neutral-400 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
					Great technology starts with the way you think, and we take care of it. This core principle shapes how we engineer, collaborate, and deliver real results for your business.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- 6 Principles Grid -->
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
				<!-- Principle 1 -->
				<div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.015] hover:border-cyan-500/30 hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-300 space-y-4 group">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400/10 border border-cyan-400/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400 font-mono font-bold text-sm">01</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-syne text-white group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">Engineering</h3>
					<p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
						We build autonomous platforms where AI, cloud, DevOps, and modern software architecture come together to solve real enterprise-scale challenges.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Principle 2 -->
				<div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.015] hover:border-blue-500/30 hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-300 space-y-4 group">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-400/10 border border-blue-400/20 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 font-mono font-bold text-sm">02</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-syne text-white group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Innovation</h3>
					<p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
						At DiceForce IT, we are transforming emerging AI technologies into production-ready software that creates a measurable impact on your business.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Principle 3 -->
				<div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.015] hover:border-indigo-500/30 hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-300 space-y-4 group">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-400/10 border border-indigo-400/20 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 font-mono font-bold text-sm">03</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-syne text-white group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">Intelligence</h3>
					<p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
						Powering autonomous decision-making in enterprises through Agentic AI, AI/ML, enterprise data, and intelligent orchestration.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Principle 4 -->
				<div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.015] hover:border-purple-500/30 hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-300 space-y-4 group">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-400/10 border border-purple-400/20 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 font-mono font-bold text-sm">04</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-syne text-white group-hover:text-purple-400 transition-colors">Partnership</h3>
					<p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
						We don't just consult; we integrate. At DiceForce IT, we extend your team with AI specialists, solution architects, and delivery squads who are as committed to your success.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Principle 5 -->
				<div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.015] hover:border-pink-500/30 hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-300 space-y-4 group">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-pink-400/10 border border-pink-400/20 flex items-center justify-center text-pink-400 font-mono font-bold text-sm">05</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-syne text-white group-hover:text-pink-400 transition-colors">Ownership</h3>
					<p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
						We take full responsibility for what we build. From initial discovery to final deployment, we deliver every project with absolute accountability.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Principle 6 -->
				<div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.015] hover:border-teal-500/30 hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-300 space-y-4 group">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-teal-400/10 border border-teal-400/20 flex items-center justify-center text-teal-400 font-mono font-bold text-sm">06</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-syne text-white group-hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors">Precision</h3>
					<p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
						DiceForce IT solves real-world problems with highly disciplined engineering and execution-focused solutions to ensure high business performance.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- SECTION 5: WHAT WE HELP ORGANIZATIONS ACHIEVE -->
		<section id="achieve" class="space-y-12 pt-16">
			<div class="space-y-4 max-w-3xl">
				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 border border-cyan-500/20 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/20">
					<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 uppercase">BUSINESS OUTCOMES</span>
				</div>
				<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold font-syne text-white tracking-tight">
					What We Help Organizations Achieve
				</h2>
				<p class="text-neutral-400 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
					Every engagement begins with a business challenge, not a technology recommendation.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
				<!-- Card 1 -->
				<div class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] hover:border-cyan-400/30 hover:bg-white/[0.04] transition-all duration-300 space-y-4 group">
					<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-400/10 border border-cyan-400/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
						</svg>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold font-syne text-white group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">AI Engineering & Intelligent Systems</h3>
					<p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
						We build production-ready AI/ML solutions, cognitive applications, and enterprise AI platforms that actually leverage your business data to develop smart, actionable outcomes.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Card 2 -->
				<div class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] hover:border-blue-400/30 hover:bg-white/[0.04] transition-all duration-300 space-y-4 group">
					<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-400/10 border border-blue-400/20 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" />
						</svg>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold font-syne text-white group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Cloud, DevOps & Platform Modernization</h3>
					<p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-light select-text">
						We bring legacy applications into the future. By using cloud-native architecture, CI/CD, Infrastructure as Code (IaC), and platform engineering, we help your system to become agile, resilient, and efficient.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Card 3 -->
				<div class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] hover:border-indigo-400/30 hover:bg-white/[0.04] transition-all duration-300 space-y-4 group">
					<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-400/10 border border-indigo-400/20 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
						</svg>
					</div>
